            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI am pretty sure it works as expected. In provided repro setup, in my regular config, and in fresh MiniMax. Here is how it looks with provided repro setup:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82d04646-6265-486f-bece-936615f99242\n\nThe problem here might be that the terminal emulator, window manager, or OS in your setup doesn't forward `<C-Space>` to Neovim. Maybe it has special meaning/mapping. In that case replacing `<C-Space>` either outside Neovim or in 'mini.pick' should fix this.",
